From d9e69579e255f69ba15f061d518e79a36de3bf1d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gabriel Fernandez <gabriel.fernandez@foss.st.com>
Date: Wed, 15 Apr 2026 09:31:50 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 479/913] clk: stm32: create a dedicated sub directory for
 STM32 clock drivers

Move all STM32MP clock drivers into the stm32 sub directory.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 82317327f2a4aed010997f643ee21a4233ca4bf2 clk: stm32: create a dedicated sub directory for STM32 clock drivers]
Signed-off-by: Gabriel Fernandez <gabriel.fernandez@foss.st.com>
Change-Id: I40305cc20aac8b8ea5b1738bdf313e5c32887ed5
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/optee/optee_os/+/570764
Reviewed-by: Thomas BOURGOIN <thomas.bourgoin@foss.st.com>
Tested-by: Thomas BOURGOIN <thomas.bourgoin@foss.st.com>
Domain-Review: Thomas BOURGOIN <thomas.bourgoin@foss.st.com>
---
 core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp1/conf.mk             | 1 +
 core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp2/conf.mk             | 1 +
 core/drivers/clk/{ => stm32}/clk-stm32-core.c   | 0
 core/drivers/clk/{ => stm32}/clk-stm32-core.h   | 0
 core/drivers/clk/{ => stm32}/clk-stm32-rcc.c    | 0
 core/drivers/clk/{ => stm32}/clk-stm32mp13.c    | 0
 core/drivers/clk/{ => stm32}/clk-stm32mp15.c    | 0
 core/drivers/clk/{ => stm32}/clk-stm32mp2-cal.c | 0
 core/drivers/clk/{ => stm32}/clk-stm32mp21.c    | 0
 core/drivers/clk/{ => stm32}/clk-stm32mp25.c    | 0
 core/drivers/clk/stm32/sub.mk                   | 6 ++++++
 core/drivers/clk/sub.mk                         | 9 ++-------
 12 files changed, 10 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)
 rename core/drivers/clk/{ => stm32}/clk-stm32-core.c (100%)
 rename core/drivers/clk/{ => stm32}/clk-stm32-core.h (100%)
 rename core/drivers/clk/{ => stm32}/clk-stm32-rcc.c (100%)
 rename core/drivers/clk/{ => stm32}/clk-stm32mp13.c (100%)
 rename core/drivers/clk/{ => stm32}/clk-stm32mp15.c (100%)
 rename core/drivers/clk/{ => stm32}/clk-stm32mp2-cal.c (100%)
 rename core/drivers/clk/{ => stm32}/clk-stm32mp21.c (100%)
